        <activityName xml:lang="en">Explosive production plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Explosive production plant
All data are estimations based on personal communication and aerial photographs. This module should not be used if its relative importance would be high in a certain environmental inventory.;
UUID: 261826e9-7124-3074-824e-ec8152b5b969
includes the infrastructure (buildings multi-storey and halls and equipment) and the land-use (built and not built areas)
Location: For some exchanges RER- and DE-modules have been used as proxy
Technology: Assumption that data valid for avarage Swiss plant
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: All other In- and Output modules are estimations 
Extrapolations: See geography
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_261826e9-7124-3074-824e-ec8152b5b969.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
